<title>USA: Avon Grove SD, Pa., $9.995 mln adjusted TIC.</title>
<headline>Avon Grove SD, Pa., $9.995 mln adjusted TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Avon Grove School District, Pa., said Monday it recalculated William R Hough &amp; Co's winning bid on the District's $9.995 mill ion Series 1996 general obligation bond issue.</p>
<p>The District said the true interest cost was 5.332 percent reflecting the co st of bond insurance, not the 5.31 percent orginally calculated.</p>
</text>
